  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UK-Brazil-Africa Trilateral Research Partnership for Climate-Smart Agriculture</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A programme to accelerate the development of solutions to underpin climate-resilient, sustainable agriculture and food systems in sub-Saharan Africa and South Asia through triangular cooperation. Supporting the facilitation of exchanges by building on the experiences, strengths and complementarities between selected African organisations and countries, Brazil, and the UK</narrative>
